OL,3,GNEWSAFirst all-female fire crew makes
OL,4,Astation history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA station manager said it "felt
OL,7,Felectric" when an all-female
OL,8,Ffirefighter crew was on duty for the
OL,9,Fvery first time.
OL,11,FNuneaton Fire Station marked a
OL,12,Fsignificant moment in its history when
OL,13,Fthe all-female crew were on duty
OL,14,Ftogether on Sunday, collectively
OL,15,Fbringing almost 44 years of experience.
OL,17,FDawn Roodhouse, who started her career
OL,18,Fwhen she was 18, told BBC CWR that to
OL,19,Fhave an all-female crew was fantastic
OL,20,Fand the fire service needs more women.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
