OL,3,GNEWSAFirst all-female fire crew makes
OL,4,Astation history
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was the third woman in the service
OL,7,Fto join when I started my career and I
OL,8,Fthink the more women we have the more
OL,9,Fof chance we have to change attitudes,"
OL,10,Fshe added.
